    "# News Recommendation with MLflow Tracking\n",
    "\n",
    "## Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates state-of-the-art news recommendation using:\n",
    "- **Content-based filtering** with TF-IDF and cosine similarity\n",
    "- **Collaborative filtering** with matrix factorization\n",
    "- **Hybrid approach** combining both methods\n",
    "- **MLflow** for experiment tracking and model registry\n",
    "- **LightFM** for hybrid recommendations (warm-start handling)\n",
    "\n",
    "## MLOps Best Practices\n",
    "- Reproducible experiments with MLflow\n",
    "- Model versioning and registry\n",
    "- Hyperparameter tuning\n",
    "- Performance metrics tracking\n",
    "\n",
    "## Libraries Used\n",
    "- `scikit-learn`: TF-IDF, cosine similarity\n",
    "- `lightfm`: Hybrid collaborative filtering\n",
    "- `mlflow`: Experiment tracking\n",
    "- `pandas`, `numpy`: Data manipulation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
